Package: nir-intelligence-main
Version: 1.0.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Martin <MC1stone@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 400000
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, sqlite3
Recommends: quarto
Description: NIR Intelligence Platform - fully local NIR spectroscopy analysis
 Django + CrewAI multi-agent platform for NIR spectroscopy analysis:
 project upload, metadata editing, agent-based analysis (spectral, sensor,
 PCA, neural network XAI, calibration, FAISS similarity), student-friendly
 final report with embedded chatbot, persistent spectral database.
 Installs to /opt/nir_intelligence, provides the systemd service
 nir_intelligence (web UI on http://127.0.0.1:8000).
